  <!-- ===== intro ===== -->
  <row>
    <panel>
      <html>
        <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px;">dCloud Splunk Lab</h1>
        <p style="color:#cdd9e5;max-width:900px;">
          A <b>self-rebuilding</b> Splunk demo lab for Cisco dCloud. The VM resets to an empty
          template each session, so on startup one command pulls this repo from GitHub and
          re-creates the whole configuration — indexes, RBAC, users, dashboards — from code.
          Nothing is configured by hand, so the lab is identical every time.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#8b98a5;">
          <b>Foundation:</b> location-based RBAC — each location's data lives in its own indexes
          and roles grant access per location. &#160;•&#160; <b>Repo:</b>
          <a href="https://github.com/js-csco/splunk-dcloud" target="_blank">github.com/js-csco/splunk-dcloud</a>
          &#160;•&#160; New here? Open <b>Setup Status</b> to confirm everything loaded.
        </p>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>

